# D1 — Password guessing
# Logic: At least five auth failures for one account and source endpoint in a 5-minute bin.
# Threshold: 5 failures / 5m / source endpoint + account (lab-tuned, per src_ip)
# Confidence: High
# ATT&CK: T1110.001   CWE: none
# Validated: 2026-10-14 — positive fired (6 failures), negative silent, isolated case windows
index=c09 event=auth outcome=failure
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count by _time, src_ip, src_port, user_ref
| where count >= 5
